  "title": "Θ -Categories and Tannakian duality",
  "authors_raw": "Joost NUITEN, Bertrand TOEN",
  "title_lines": [
   "Θ-Categories and Tannakian duality"
  ],
  "abstract": "We introduce a notion of Θ-categories, which is a refinement of the notion of symmetric monoidal ∞-categories. We use this notion to prove a Tannakian duality statement, relating Θ-categories with fpqc- stacks by means of a certain stack of fiber functors in the context of Θ-categories. This provides, over a base ring of arbitrary characteris- tic, a strong link between Tannakian Θ-categories and the schematic homotopy types of [Toe06].",
